 innovative and  only needs a little polishing for the  next week he works on the project and  completes it when it's done they fly the  drone to roy's room only to see his  corpse they run to his room and witness  that he has committed the unthinkable  during his funeral rancho tells virus  that roy was murdered by the college's  system of pressuring students virus  takes the comment personally and writes  a letter to farhan and raju's parents  telling them that rancho is a bad  influence on their sons virus should be  in jail the very next day farhan's  father calls them home and asks rancho  to stay away from his son rancho ignores  his words distracted by the wildlife  pictures on the wall it turns out that  farhan wants to be a wildlife  photographer but has taken engineering  because of his father rancho tries to  convince his father otherwise but it is  not enough to eradicate his deep-rooted  and shallow principle after that they go  to raju's home and finds out that his  family lives below poverty his father is  bedridden and retired while his sister  is getting older but no one wants to  marry her the family's responsibility  falls upon raju which is why he is  always so scared of the future later the  friends pretend to be guests at a  wedding to enjoy the food rancho notices  a girl named pia and her fiance talking  about her watch by the conversation it  is clear that the guy suhas is a  materialistic man who is only marrying  her for her status rancho tells pia what  he thinks about suhas and drops a  dressing into his shoes to prove to her  how materialistic he is as expected  suhas cries out the price of his shoes  and yells at the waiter for ruining them  intrigued by rancho's personality pia  does some digging and finds out that he  is her father viruses student to the  guy's misfortune the wedding they broke  into is virus's elder daughters pia  tells her father about the three and  gets them in trouble the night before  exams chatura slips adult 